                    <msContents><!-- describe the intellectual content of an inscription -->
                        <summary>
                            This inscription records the endowment of a Jaina temple by Attimabbe at Lakkundi. The available contents of the inscription seem to mirror those of INSKalyanaCalukya00023, which strongly indicates that that inscription is a copy of this one. 
                            This inscription was found in four incomplete fragments which contain a very limited amount of the original text. 
                        </summary>
                        <!-- offers the possibility to give a summary of the inscription's content -->
                    </msContents>
